# Humility against the other sublayers of layer 7 (CR 613.4): Bot2's Tarmogoyf defines its own power and toughness
# (a characteristic-defining ability, layer 7a) - with Bot1's Lightning Bolt in a graveyard it is 1/2 before Humility.
# Humility takes that ability in layer 6 (its */1+* then counts as 0/1, CR 604.3, 613.1f), and sets 1/1 in layer 7b
# after it either way: Tarmogoyf is 1/1, not 1/2. Bot1's Walking Ballista (X = 2) removes one of its +1/+1 counters to
# deal 1 damage to Bot2 before Humility (the positive control for its abilities). Under Humility it has no abilities, so
# it can't remove its other counter (the refusal), and that +1/+1 counter still applies on top of the base 1/1 (layer
# 7c): a 2/2, where Humility's 1/1 alone, or a 0/0 with its counter, would be 1/1.

